"part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You're all booked for Mexico!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when giving travel tips."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shopping"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the activity of going to shops and buying things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Shopping hours start at around 10 a.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to carry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have something with you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You carry small amounts of money with you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to withdraw"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to remove money from the bank"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can withdraw money during the day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "currency exchange booth"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place you can exchange the currency of one country for another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to go to a  currency exchange booth."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to continue"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to keep happening; to keep doing something without stopping"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They start at 10 a.m. and continue until 10 p.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le05ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read each role below and choose one."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the situation with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are the customer. The travel agent offers to share tips. Accept their offer. Thank them for the information.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are the travel agent. You offer to share tips with the customer. They accept. They thank you. Respond to the thanks.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about travel and money."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I offer tips and suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I thank and respond to thanks."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le05ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le05ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le05ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Travel Agent</span>: Okay. Ms. Wright. You are all booked for Mexico. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Great, thank you!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Travel Agent</span>: May I offer you some tips about travelling to Mexico?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, of c